This wall-mounted smart vending machine combines a compact cabinet, large touchscreen, cashless payment layout and configurable product channels for modern unattended retail.

BOHOL can review product dimensions, merchandising layout, destination-market payments, network configuration, cabinet finish and branded touchscreen UI before production.
